sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant API as Kubernetes API
    participant Sch as Scheduler
    participant Kb as Kubelet
    participant DP as Device plugin
    participant GPU as GPU
    U->>API: pod requesting nvidia.com/gpu
    API->>Sch: schedule it
    Sch->>Sch: filter to nodes advertising a free GPU
    Note over Sch: Kubernetes only counts GPUs — it does not understand them
    Sch->>Kb: bind to the node
    Kb->>DP: Allocate
    DP-->>Kb: device files and driver mounts to inject
    Kb->>GPU: container gets the device, whole
    Note over DP,GPU: allocation is exclusive by default — sharing needs MPS, time-slicing, or MIG
    alt the node has several GPUs
        Note over Sch,GPU: topology matters — NVLink peers beat two GPUs on different PCIe roots
    end
